# Everything below is generated, machine-local, or editor/OS noise.
# The repo should only ever track what's needed to build VOCAN (source,
# Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, tests), the setup scripts, and project docs/CI.

# --- Rust / Cargo build output (debug and release both live under here) -----
/target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# --- Editors / IDEs -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
.vs/
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# --- OS junk -------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Editor swap/backup files --------------------------------------------------
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig

# --- Local secrets/config (never commit these) ---------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# --- Logs ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- Downloaded/extracted setup-script artifacts, if ever run from repo root --
/deep-filter
/deep-filter.exe
/ffmpeg
/ffmpeg.exe
